          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Starting a skill training centre works when you pick a skill with local job demand, hire trainers who can do the work, check approvals and affiliations first and make only claims you can prove, because a centre depends on the trust of students and local employers."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Confirm demand with local employers, then add courses and centres as results come in."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Registration, affiliation, tax and consumer rules differ by state and course type."
          }
